  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rice Paddy Production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Rice, Beneficiaries: 109 (7 women), Description: The group seeks to install an irrigation system with drainage to increase area under production from 72 ha to 190 ha, conduct two campaigns per year as opposed to only one at present, increase average yield from 5.7 T/ha to 6.1 T/ha based on improved water access and reduced salinization plus training in best production practices, and improve management and financial capacity skills.</narrative>
  </description>
